  "question": {
    "html": "<p>The siren of a stationary fire truck emits a sound wave of speed <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"c\"></span> and wavelength <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\lambda\"></span>. Then the fire truck starts moving towards a stationary observer. What are the speed and the wavelength of the sound wave as detected by the observer?</p>\n\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td></td>\n<td>\n<p><strong>Speed detected by observer</strong></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><strong>Wavelength detected by observer</strong></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-label=\"A\">\n<td><strong>A.</strong></td>\n<td>Larger than <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"c\"></span></td>\n<td>Longer than <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\lambda\"></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-label=\"B\">\n<td><strong>B.</strong></td>\n<td>Larger than <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"c\"></span></td>\n<td>Shorter than <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\lambda\"></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-label=\"C\">\n<td><strong>C.</strong></td>\n<td><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"c\"></span></td>\n<td>Longer than <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\lambda\"></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-label=\"D\">\n<td><strong>D.</strong></td>\n<td><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"c\"></span></td>\n<td>Shorter than <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\lambda\"></span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>"
  },
